    "text": "In a uniform magnetic field of strength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>, a&nbsp;short bar magnet of magnetic moment <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>J T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is placed. The potential energy of the magnet in its unstable equilibrium position is",
